---
// Standalone glassmorphism prototype (noindex, not in sitemap).
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Meridian — Heavy glass</title>
<style is:inline>
:root{--blur:40px;--glass:rgba(28,30,34,.55);--line:rgba(255,255,255,.10);--hi:rgba(255,255,255,.08);--fg:#f2f3f5;--muted:#a9adb5;--accent:#e8e9eb;--r:18px;
--shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.2),0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.25),0 32px 64px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.6 Inter,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,"SF Pro Text",system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;
background:radial-gradient(60vw 50vh at 15% 20%,#3a3f47 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(50vw 50vh at 85% 70%,#2b4038 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(40vw 40vh at 60% 10%,#4a4136 0,transparent 60%),#121316;background-attachment:fixed}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,.015) 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px)}
.glass{background:var(--glass);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(var(--blur)) saturate(140%);backdrop-filter:blur(var(--blur)) saturate(140%);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 var(--hi),var(--shadow)}
@supports not ((backdrop-filter:blur(1px)) or (-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(1px))){.glass{background:#1c1e22}}
@media (prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce){.glass{background:#1c1e22;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none;backdrop-filter:none}}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
nav{position:sticky;top:16px;z-index:5;margin:16px auto 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px 10px 20px;max-width:1080px}
.logo{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em}nav ul{display:flex;gap:22px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}nav ul a{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}nav ul a:hover{color:var(--fg)}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:3px;border-radius:8px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;background:var(--accent);color:#111;transition:transform .2s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}.btn.ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:120px 0 80px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,80px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.045em;font-weight:600;margin:16px 0}
.hero p{color:var(--muted);font-size:19px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 32px}
.pill{display:inline-block;font-size:13px;padding:6px 12px;color:var(--muted)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin:40px 0 100px}
.card{padding:28px}.card h3{margin:14px 0 6px;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.01em}.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
.ico{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:16px}
h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.035em;text-align:center;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:600}.sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 40px}
.pricing{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:100px}
.plan{padding:32px}.plan .price{font-size:40px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:600;margin:8px 0}.plan ul{padding:0;list-style:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:20px 0 28px}.plan li{padding:6px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.plan.featured{--glass:rgba(40,43,48,.7);outline:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22)}
footer{padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:800px){.grid,.pricing{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav ul{display:none}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style></head><body>
<nav class="glass"><span class="logo">◐ Meridian</span><ul><li><a href="#features">Product</a></li><li><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a href="#">Docs</a></li></ul><a class="btn" href="#pricing">Get started</a></nav>
<main class="wrap">
<section class="hero"><span class="pill glass">New · Shared timelines are here</span><h1>Plan the work.<br>Quietly ship it.</h1><p>Meridian is a calm workspace for teams who would rather build than manage tools. Fast, keyboard-first, and out of your way.</p><a class="btn" href="#pricing">Start free</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="#features">See how it works</a></section>
<section id="features" class="grid">
<div class="card glass"><div class="ico">⌘</div><h3>Keyboard-first</h3><p>Every action is two keystrokes away. No menus to hunt through.</p></div>
<div class="card glass"><div class="ico">↻</div><h3>Instant sync</h3><p>Changes land everywhere in under 50 ms, even offline.</p></div>
<div class="card glass"><div class="ico">◎</div><h3>Focused views</h3><p>See only what matters this week. The rest waits patiently.</p></div>
<div class="card glass"><div class="ico">⇄</div><h3>Integrations</h3><p>Git, chat and calendar, connected without glue code.</p></div>
<div class="card glass"><div class="ico">▤</div><h3>Clear reports</h3><p>Progress you can read in ten seconds, not ten slides.</p></div>
<div class="card glass"><div class="ico">⛨</div><h3>Private by default</h3><p>SSO, audit logs and regional data residency included.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="pricing"><h2>Simple pricing</h2><p class="sub">Start free. Upgrade when your team does.</p>
<div class="pricing">
<div class="plan glass"><strong>Starter</strong><div class="price">$0</div><span style="color:var(--muted)">For individuals</span><ul><li>Unlimited issues</li><li>2 projects</li><li>Community support</li></ul><a class="btn ghost" href="#">Choose Starter</a></div>
<div class="plan glass featured"><strong>Team</strong><div class="price">$8</div><span style="color:var(--muted)">per seat / month</span><ul><li>Unlimited projects</li><li>Timelines &amp; reports</li><li>Priority support</li></ul><a class="btn" href="#">Choose Team</a></div>
<div class="plan glass"><strong>Enterprise</strong><div class="price">Custom</div><span style="color:var(--muted)">For organizations</span><ul><li>SSO &amp; SCIM</li><li>Audit logs</li><li>Dedicated manager</li></ul><a class="btn ghost" href="#">Contact sales</a></div>
</div></section>
<footer class="glass"><span>© 2026 Meridian Labs</span><span>Privacy · Terms · Status</span></footer>
</main></body></html>
